      "rating": null,
      "title": "Fair to good for the money.",
      "review_text": "The umbrella fair to good. Seems a lil' wobbly in a few places on pole. Just goes with saying, they don't make things like they used to. We have one in a table / stand %26 it still wobbles a lil'. Was a lil' surprised. A lil' hard to crank. The other one in a floor stand. Had to reinforce the pole in stand with a wedge of wood. For the price, they are ok. I think they'll be fine if we fold them down with tie in wind and/or rainey weather, which we try to do anyway. I'd say they're great for the price. A lil' worried about the wobble in them , but will keep watch. If you leave home for a while, put down %26 tie, you never know when wind/storm will pop up.",
